#ipsypartner I am always so excited when I receive my @ipsy Glam Bag and Glam Bag Plus. And let me tell you… this month…I was SO excited to receive my favorite lip gloss in the Glam Bag. The Complex Culture Kiss Bliss Lip Gloss in Joy De Vivre. Obsessed. And I also love the Alleyoop Multitasker and will be using it allllll summer long. I've even teamed up with IPSY to giveaway a free 1-year subscription to Glam Bag, and all the Complex Culture Kiss Bliss Lip Glosses to one lucky winner and a friend! Here's how to enter:

1. Follow @ipsy & @baileysarian 
2. Like this post 
3. Tag a friend
4. Include #IPSY & #Giveaway in your comment

Deadline to enter is 07/27/22 at 11:59 p.m. PST and the winner will be announced by 08/02/22. ⁠To enter this giveaway, you must be 18 years old or older and a resident of the U.S. or Canada (excluding the Province of Quebec). By posting your comment with these hashtags, you agree to be bound by the terms of the Official Giveaway Rules at www.ipsy.com/contest-terms. This giveaway is in no way sponsored, endorsed or administered by, or associated with, Instagram.

Also, here are all the great things I received this month:

Glam Bag Plus
@aboutfacebeauty Light Lock Lip Gloss in PAYTON
@kimchichicbeauty Thailor Bronzer in 01 I Went To Malibu
@anastasiabeverlyhills Clear Brow Gel
@quayaustralia HINDSIGHT black/smoke
