@meetalleyoop Multi-Tasker

Glam Bag 
@complexculturebeauty Kiss Bliss Lip Gloss in Joy De Vivre
@maccosmetics M·A·CSTACK MASCARA
@oseamalibu Ocean Cleanser
@belleenargent Shimmer Taupe Eyeshadow Duo Callsheet + Production
@tartecosmetics Shape Tape™ Ultra Creamy Concealer in Light Medium

