postscraped:
Benefit Brow Search 2023

About last night 😍

This year, @benefitcosmetics invited me, alongside @mannymua733 and @patrickstarrr to coach 24 beauty content creators in becoming the BEST IN BROWS! 

This experience exceeded any expectation I had. Team Mikayla was a team of 8 incredible aspiring content creators. I had the opportunity to coach my team and inspire them! But in reality, they inspired me! I loved being a coach. Our team brought the energy, and we SHOWED UP with each challenge! We were not there to mess around! My love for these creators is through the ROOF! 😊

You have to check out their pages and follow them!
@kellysweetbeauty
@danielleelliott__
@serenttaaa
@ashleyvmakeup
@traceydoesmakeup
@vmeers
@jadacmakeupartistry
@ciana.barbie 

We all bonded over one common theme: dreams. And with that in mind, as a team, we won multiple challenges and ultimately SWEPT THE COMPETITION! 1st, 2nd, and 3rd place winners, TEAM MIKAYLA! Congrats to our BEST IN BROWS WINNER @serenttaaa! She is so deserving and won an incredible $50,000! Congrats to the TEAM MIKAYLA MVP and third place winner, @ciana.barbie! And a major congrats to @traceydoesmakeup, our second place winner! These three ladies are seriously some of the most incredible people I’ve ever met! I was so happy to see the three of them up there last night. 

Thank you so much again to @benefitcosmetics for believing in me and giving me this opportunity. It is something I will NEVER forget! This is what the beauty community is all about! This entire trip was filled with LOVE & POSITIVITY! And a shit ton of makeup too! 😊🙌🏻💞

